{"code":"A05","wikidata":"Q6633722","wikipedia":{"en":"Hua Mak station (Airport Rail Link)","th":"สถานีหัวหมาก (รถไฟฟ้าเชื่อมท่าอากาศยานสุวรรณภูมิ)"},"summary":{"en":"Hua Mak station is a station on the Eastern Line of the State Railway of Thailand, an Airport Rail Link station and an MRT station on the Yellow Line, located on Srinagarindra Road in Phatthanakan Subdistrict, Suan Luang District, Bangkok. Three rail operators run the station complex separately at their respective stations, with no paid area integration between the three stations.","th":"สถานีหัวหมาก อยู่ในพื้นที่ แขวงพัฒนาการ เขตสวนหลวง กรุงเทพมหานคร เป็นที่ตั้งของสถานีรถไฟ 3 รูปแบบ และ 1 โครงการ ได้แก่"},"opened":"2010-08-23","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Bangkok_Hua_Mak_Station.jpg/960px-Bangkok_Hua_Mak_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bangkok_Hua_Mak_Station.jpg","author":"nutnano","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/202402_Airport_Link_Inbound_Platform_of_Hua_Mak_Station.jpg/960px-202402_Airport_Link_Inbound_Platform_of_Hua_Mak_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:202402_Airport_Link_Inbound_Platform_of_Hua_Mak_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Hua_Mak_Station_%28Airport_Rail_Link%29_20220501-1.jpg/960px-Hua_Mak_Station_%28Airport_Rail_Link%29_20220501-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hua_Mak_Station_(Airport_Rail_Link)_20220501-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Hua_Mak_Station_%28Airport_Rail_Link%29_20220501-2.jpg/960p